Title:
Bad Breath
Credit: Written By
Author: Michael Glaser-Garbrick
Draft Date: 2025-09-17


INT. Standing in a grocery line

GROCERY GIRL
Oh my god? Are you STEPHEN? You know that STEPHEN? Famous horror novelist STEPHEN

STEPHEN
Yes

GROCERY GIRL (CONT'D)
(clears throat)
Oh I don't want to make a scene

STEPHEN
Oh no it's alright I get this all the time.

GROCERY GIRL	
(Grimaces and clears throat)
Excuse me I need to leave

CHECKOUT MAN
WAIT CINDY COME BACK! Look at what you did. Scaring my girl away

STEPHEN
She talked to me first

CHECKOUT MAN	
Okay "STEPHEN" I'm going to have to get my manager

STEPHEN
What why?

CHECKOUT MAN	
On the account of you "scaring" away patrons. You know for a horror novelist, you sure don't know horror in day to day life

CHECKOUT MAN (V.O.)
MANAGER TO CHECKOUT 3. MANAGER TO CHECKOUT 3. WE HAVE A CODE F

STEPHEN	
What the hell man?

CHECKOUT MAN	
Apparently your aura is too strong, otherwise Cindy, my woman, would still be here

STEPHEN
It's not my fault!

CHECKOUT MAN	
Listen it's for the greater good of the store. 

STEPHEN
Greater good?

STEPHEN approaches the cash register

STEPHEN (CONT'D)
I'm the victim here

CHECKOUT MAN	
Sir I'm going to need you to stop. My condolences. I'm sorry I didn't know

STEPHEN
Condolences? For what?

CHECKOUT MAN runs out crying

STEPHEN (CONT'D)
That was bizarre

MANAGER
Code F eh? A celebrity trying to flaunt his influence

MANAGER Approaches

MANAGER (CONT'D)
You know we don't take too kindly to your kind around here

STEPHEN
I'm just trying to buy some groceries

MANAGER	
Groceries? Look around. There is nobody left in the store but us two proud grizzly bears duking it out in the end

STEPHEN
(sighs)
Grizzlies? What do bears have to do with this?

MANAGER
(frantic)
OH GOOD LORD. I need help. I need the Glorious United States Army. 

MANAGER radios

STEPHEN
THE ARMY?!

MANAGER
Sir I need you to calm down

STEPHEN
How can I be calm when you radio'd the army on me

ARMY (V.O.)
COME OUT WITH YOUR HANDS UP. WE HAVE YOU SURROUNDED

STEPHEN
I'm not coming out, I'm buying my groceries

ARMY (V.O.)
SIR WE NEED YOU TO RELEASE YOUR HOSTAGE

STEPHEN
I will not let this man out of my sight

MANAGER
Hey? You like sloppy toppy right? You like it when somebody caress your balls? I don't have a gag reflex. Let me be your throat goat. You can use me and throw me away. 

STEPHEN
What?


MANAGER	
I'll do the nastiest shit you ever seen to your feet. I'll make Quentin Tarantino look at you with envy

STEPHEN	
What the hell


MANAGER
Please I will do anything you say. I have a family

STEPHEN
I just want to go home and see my family

ARMY (V.O.)
WE CAN ARRANGE TRANSPORTATION FOR YOU

STEPHEN
Honestly I'm so fucking sick of this. I don't even want these groceries anymore

ARMY (V.O.)
WE NEED PROOF OF LIFE FOR YOUR HOSTAGE

MANAGER runs out crying

ARMY (CONT'D)
NOW YOU SIR

STEPHEN sombers out

STEPHEN	
There are you happy?

ARMY (CONT'D)
Is he in your sights *clamoring yes* Okay okay. Make Lee Harvey Oswald proud
===

THOUGHTS - and revisions
I did want to upload it so that I at least put something up there. I want to change how the manager and grocer talk. Like maybe make the grocer more of a hippy type
